  _description: '<b>Recommended Level</b>: 4-7


    <b>Description</b>The verdant
    marsh lands surrounding lake Ancahato are filled with all manner of dangerous
    swamp creatures, dangerouser swamp plants, and Kobalds. It''s a great location
    for aspiring alchemists to venture for their initial experiments, provided they
    can survive, as useful materials are abundant and high quality.


    <b>Enemies</b>:
    Venus Mancatcher, Poison Ivy, Kobald, Giant Mosquito, Crocodile

    <b>Herbs</b>:
    Chalkadonny, Silverfrond, Marshweed

    <b>Ores</b>: Iron, Cobalt

    <b>Chemicals</b>:
    Morte Gas, Silverwater, Peat'
